        <h4 class="page-header">INTER PARLIAMENTARY RELATIONS (IPR)</h4>
            <div style="text-align:justify">
        <p>
            IPR Division, Senate Secretariat deals with all matters related to Pakistan Senate's relations with its regional and global parliamentary
            counterparts and ensures Pakistan's representation at all important international parliamentary events. With this mandate, the IPR Division handles related correspondence and facilities
            the honorable members to play an effective role during their interactions and participation at various events abroad.</p>
        <p>
            Whenever a Senate delegation travels to a foreign country for attending any international event or bilateral visit, it is briefed and provided with each and every detail of the proceedings,
            particularly Pakistan's position on the topic, theme of the event and Pakistan's stance on it. This inpuut and position of Pakistan, provided by the IPR Division is based on briefs, which is sought from concerned Departments/Ministries particularly Ministry
            of Foreign Affairs.

        </p>
